    <string name="conflicts_intro">These apps change the same carrier settings. Android keeps only the value written last, so they can overwrite yours.</string>
    <string name="conflict_active">Its settings are active on your SIM right now, and it re-applies them every time Shizuku starts. Tap to open app info.</string>
    <string name="conflict_automatic">Re-applies its own carrier settings by itself, so it can overwrite yours after a reboot. Tap to open app info.</string>
